# The Kimeria arms (#350) and the sun lighting up on the ending page (#416, D95): 24x36 native pixel art.
# Frame `lit` is art/heraldry/kimeria-arms.png pixel for pixel (tools/arms_sprites.py checks it); the others change the sun only.
# The ending plays dark, ember, glow, kindle, flare, then holds lit (IntroScreen); the menu (#415) draws lit.
